{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6018003050010","name":"冬優子","text":"プロデューサーさん、スタッフさん！\r\nやりました！","trans":"制作人，各位工作人员！\n成功了！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6018003050020","name":"冬優子","text":"敗者復活戦、突破です♡","trans":"败者复活赛，突破了♡","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-3","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おめでとう、冬優子！","trans":"恭喜你，冬优子！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6018003050030","name":"冬優子","text":"ふふ……！\r\nこの勢いのまま、決勝も頑張ります！","trans":"呵呵……！\n就保持这个势头，决赛也会努力的！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6018003050040","name":"冬優子","text":"期待しててください♡","trans":"请期待着吧♡","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6018003050050","name":"冬優子","text":"──なんて\r\nちょっと大きく出てみちゃいました……！","trans":"——话虽这么说\n好像有点说得太满了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"取材スタッフ","text":"あはは、楽しみにしてます！","trans":"啊哈哈，我很期待哦！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"冬優子ならやれるさ\r\n──頼んだぞ","trans":"冬优子的话能做得到\n——拜托了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6018003050060","name":"冬優子","text":"はいっ","trans":"嗯！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}